      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1980,
        776
      ],
      "size": [
        420,
        310
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Markdown Note: Usage / Caution",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "🔗 SamplerLCM, BasicScheduler\n\n### Why SamplerLCM at 6 steps\nWith euler at 16 MP, skin and hair get a blocky \"compressed video\" texture and over-sharpened HDR; SamplerLCM with s_noise 1.10 falling to 0.90 over 6 simple steps gives clean skin with pores and clean eyes and teeth.\n\n### A simpler option with one dropdown\nA plain KSampler with sampler_name \"lcm\", scheduler \"simple\" and 4 steps is almost as good, a little softer.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "🔗 SamplerLCM, BasicScheduler\n\n### Why SamplerLCM at 6 steps\nWith euler at 16 MP, skin and hair get a blocky \"compressed video\" texture and over-sharpened HDR; SamplerLCM with s_noise 1.10 falling to 0.90 over 6 simple steps gives clean skin with pores and clean eyes and teeth.\n\n### A simpler option with one dropdown\nA plain KSampler with sampler_name \"lcm\", scheduler \"simple\" and 4 steps is almost as good, a little softer.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
