      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## What this workflow does\n\nTurns a long, hand-written prompt into one realistic photo of about 16 MP (3552x4736, portrait 3:4) with MiniMax H3 Image.\n\n## models\n\n- diffusion_models\n  - [minimax_h3_image_*.gguf](huggingface.co/molbal/miniMax-H3-Image-GGUF) (21 GB)\n- text_encoders\n  - [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) (15.69 GB)\n- vae\n  - [minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors) (1.17 GB)\n\nText encoder for your graphics card: The NVFP4 text encoder runs natively on RTX 50-series cards; on other cards, the int8_convrot version of the same text encoder is an option: [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors) (25.28 GB), same folder.\n\n```text\n📂ComfyUI/\n└── 📂models/\n    ├── 📂diffusion_models/\n    │   └── minimax_h3_image_*.gguf\n    ├── 📂text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n    └── 📂vae/\n        └── minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## What this workflow does\n\nTurns a long, hand-written prompt into one realistic photo of about 16 MP (3552x4736, portrait 3:4) with MiniMax H3 Image.\n\n## models\n\n- diffusion_models\n  - [minimax_h3_image_*.gguf](huggingface.co/molbal/miniMax-H3-Image-GGUF) (21 GB)\n- text_encoders\n  - [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) (15.69 GB)\n- vae\n  - [minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors) (1.17 GB)\n\nText encoder for your graphics card: The NVFP4 text encoder runs natively on RTX 50-series cards; on other cards, the int8_convrot version of the same text encoder is an option: [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors) (25.28 GB), same folder.\n\n```text\n📂ComfyUI/\n└── 📂models/\n    ├── 📂diffusion_models/\n    │   └── minimax_h3_image_*.gguf\n    ├── 📂text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n    └── 📂vae/\n        └── minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors\n```\n"
